TEST create_todo_unauthenticated

RECEIVE HTTP:POST /api/v1/todos
WITH {{payloads/create_todo_request.json}}
HEADERS
  Authorization: Bearer invalid_token

EXPECT HTTP:GET ${USER_SERVICE_URL}
HEADERS
  Authorization: Bearer invalid_token
RETURNS HTTP:401

RESPOND HTTP:401
WITH {{payloads/error_401.json}}
